":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"sunshi-q-p029","section":"chapter-046","block":"b-fd1827cd9e6549436128","layer":"pei","quote":"《英雄记》曰：“坚以初平四年正月七日死。”又云：“刘表将吕公，将兵缘山向坚；坚轻骑寻山，讨公。公兵下石，中坚头，应时脑出，物故。”其不同如此也。","attribution":"《英雄记》","section_title":"孙破虏讨逆传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0099.xhtml","index":173,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c7bf5e729acd4a0d41f3","start":0,"end":72,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-5e63888ed5d8c41275f1","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-5e63888ed5d8c41275f1","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗四年：初平四年（公元 193）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":190,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c3dba248d94a4751844d","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o024","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-c2e697c9981c6cd8d3e8","layer":"original","quote":"四年春〖1〗，军鄄城〖2〗。荆州牧刘表断术粮道〖3〗。术引军入陈留，屯封丘〖4〗；黑山余贼及于夫罗等佐之。术使将刘详屯匡亭〖5〗。太祖击详，术救之；与战，大破之。术退保封丘，遂围之；未合，术走襄邑〖6〗。追到太寿〖7〗，决渠水灌城；走宁陵〖8〗。又追之，走九江〖9〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":185,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":134,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
